  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "2. Toss almonds with honey and softened butter until well coated.",
    "3. Spread almond mixture onto a baking sheet and roast for 10-12 minutes, or until fragrant and lightly toasted.",
    "4. Meanwhile, cut baguette into 1-inch cubes.",
    "5. Thread a cube of baguette, a few almonds, and a sprig of thyme (if using) onto each skewer.",
    "6. Drizzle skewers with warm honey and sprinkle with flaky sea salt (if using).",
    "7. Serve skewers immediately, garnished with additional thyme if desired."
